    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d921-a2">

                <pb facs="0961" n="949" sameAs="frus:frus1945v08/pg949"/>

                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Enclosure 2]</seg>
                </opener>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Saudi Arabian Acting Minister for Foreign
                        Affairs</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Yassin</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic"
                        >to the American Minister in Saudi Arabia</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Eddy</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 17/2/6/83</seg>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">[<placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Riyadh</hi></placeName>,] <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1945-08-06">August 6, 1945</date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>
                    <hi rendition="#small-caps">Excellency</hi>: I have received your letter dated
                    August 5, 1945, specifying the following:—</p>
                <p>[Here follows text of letter of August 5, <hi rendition="#italic"
                    >supra</hi>.]</p>
                <p>I have the honor to inform you that the Government of Saudi <pb facs="0962"
                        n="950" xml:id="pg950"/> Arabia has agreed to what has been said in your
                    letter, the text of which is mentioned here above.</p>
                <p>Please accept my high regards.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Yusuf Yassin</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
